<title>UK: EIB sets 1.0 trillion lire zero-coupon 15-yr bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 1.0 trillion lire zero-coupon 15-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager IMI Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 TRLN LIRE COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    25.OCT.11</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  29.184    PAY DATE    25.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  60 BP     REOFFER    28.684    YIELD	 8.682</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
